From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 10:37:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-127: the Properties window is ONE table, each
 category once -- the .dfm's other properties as greyed read-only rows of it
 (0.127.0)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun: "屬性表格和事件可以像 wpf 讓使用者看起來條理分明"; the manuals check (20261001) found the
same category twice: the editable grid had 一般 / 版面 / 外觀 / 文字 and the "DFM 其他屬性" list below
had its own 版面 / 外觀 (by name: two A-Z runs). WPF's Properties window is one list ("Categorized
-- Lists all properties ... by category"; "Properties shown in gray are read-only").
Now the .dfm's other properties (Glyph.Data, ParentFont, Font.Charset...) are greyed rows of the
grid itself, in ONE set of categories (一般 / IO 元件 / 版面 / 外觀 / 文字 / 行為 / 其他); by name and
by the .dfm's order they are one run too. A grey row's marker = to its .dfm line / copy the value;
a double click = to the .dfm line. The section is titled 屬性. (Several selected: as before, the
primary one's .dfm list stays below.)
Tests: panels (grey rows Font.Charset / ParentFont in the grid, each category once, no second list,
the marker's menu); the category / name sort / fold / search checks unchanged and passing; a
screenshot checked. run_all 3/3 layers (lib 168, smoke 198).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
